{"t":"Levitate","s":"levitate-b5122","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Levitate_66daa0.gif","q":47,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Levitate</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Levitate\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Levitate_66daa0.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exani hur up<br/>exani hur down</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">50</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Support Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Support_Cooldown_5c2691.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Support (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monk</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Permits vertical movement via levitation, up or down one level.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>A variation of the Magic Rope spell, Levitate allows the caster to swiftly move onto suitable obstacles without having to climb stairs or to use ramps. The practical value of this spell is far greater than may be readily apparent, as large obstacles are a daily nuisance to the exploring adventurer. Besides, the spell is quite useful to make a quick escape in case of danger, as creatures usually abandon pursuit if their enemy moves onto higher terrain. When casting this spell you should not forget to add the necessary parameter \"up\" or \"down\" to specify whether you want to move upwards or downwards.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"The red squares shows where to stand when levitating up beside entrances.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"90\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Levitate_on_entrance_803db6.jpg\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">The red squares shows where to stand when levitating up beside entrances.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The caster cannot move up or down more than one level at a time. If this spell is cast and the character is not in the correct square to levitate, then no mana is lost.\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This spell used to be available only for players with active Premium Time. This was changed on October 08, 2024 and it is also available to Free Account players since then.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Support_Spells\">Support Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Animate Dead</li><li>Arrow Call</li><li>Aura of Exposed Weakness</li><li>Aura of Sapped Strength</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a></li><li>Avatar of Balance</li><li>Avatar of Light</li><li>Avatar of Nature</li><li>Avatar of Steel</li><li>Avatar of Storm</li><li>Balanced Brawl</li><li>Blood Rage</li><li>Cancel Invisibility</li><li>Cancel Magic Shield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a></li><li>Chameleon</li><li>Charge</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chivalrous%20Challenge\">Chivalrous Challenge</a></li><li>Conjure Arrow</li><li>Conjure Explosive Arrow</li><li>Conjure Wand of Darkness</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Convince%20Creature\">Convince Creature</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Illusion\">Creature Illusion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a></li><li>Disintegrate</li><li>Divine Dazzle</li><li>Divine Defiance</li><li>Divine Empowerment</li><li>Elemental Synthesis</li><li>Enchant Party</li><li>Enchant Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb\">Energy Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Field</a></li><li>Energy Wall</li><li>Enlighten Party</li><li>Explosion</li><li>Find Fiend</li><li>Find Person</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">Fire Field</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Wall\">Fire Wall</a></li><li>Fireball<